543
00:43:19,170 --> 00:43:20,970
Yes, you'll be very popular...

544
00:43:20,970 --> 00:43:23,060
until some fat lord comes to visit

545
00:43:23,060 --> 00:43:24,710
with a big belly and a little prick

546
00:43:24,710 --> 00:43:26,530
and he can't get it up

547
00:43:26,530 --> 00:43:27,660
so he knocks all your teeth out.

548
00:43:27,660 --> 00:43:30,210
And what will happen to me if I stay here?

549
00:43:30,300 --> 00:43:32,540
Will I become Lady Greyjoy,

550
00:43:32,540 --> 00:43:34,710
mistress of the Iron Islands?

551
00:43:34,710 --> 00:43:35,490
Don't be a fool.

552
00:43:35,490 --> 00:43:37,660
I hear Jaime Lannister attacked Lord Stark

553
00:43:37,660 --> 00:43:39,690
in the streets of King's Landing.

554
00:43:39,850 --> 00:43:42,860
Every man for a hundred miles will be marching off to war soon

555
00:43:42,860 --> 00:43:45,050
and most of them will never come back.

556
00:43:45,350 --> 00:43:47,500
There's nothing left for me here.

557
00:43:48,260 --> 00:43:50,000
Let's go, Stefon.

558
00:43:51,100 --> 00:43:52,310
Giddyap.

559
00:43:52,340 --> 00:43:53,980
Let me see it one more time!

560
00:43:54,820 --> 00:43:56,220
See what?

561
00:44:08,260 --> 00:44:09,830
I'm going to miss you.

562
00:44:10,690 --> 00:44:12,030
I know.

563
00:44:25,970 --> 00:44:27,830
I'm sending you both back to Winterfell.

564
00:44:27,830 --> 00:44:29,260
- What?! - Listen...

565
00:44:29,260 --> 00:44:30,590
What about Joffrey?

566
00:44:30,590 --> 00:44:32,320
Are you dying because of your leg?

567
00:44:32,320 --> 00:44:33,400
Is that why you're sending us home?

568
00:44:33,400 --> 00:44:34,280
What? No.

569
00:44:34,280 --> 00:44:35,560
Please, father. Please don't.

570
00:44:35,570 --> 00:44:38,090
You can't. I've got my lessons with Syrio.

571
00:44:38,090 --> 00:44:39,610
I'm finally getting good.

572
00:44:39,610 --> 00:44:41,570
This isn't a punishment.

573
00:44:42,330 --> 00:44:44,600
I want you back in Winterfell for your own safety.

574
00:44:44,600 --> 00:44:45,840
Can we take Syrio back with us?

575
00:44:45,840 --> 00:44:49,190
Who cares about your stupid dancing teacher? I can't go.

576
00:44:49,190 --> 00:44:50,740
I'm supposed to marry Prince Joffrey.

577
00:44:50,750 --> 00:44:52,850
I love him and I'm meant to be his queen

578
00:44:52,850 --> 00:44:54,580
and have his babies.

579
00:44:54,580 --> 00:44:55,360
Seven hells.

580
00:44:55,360 --> 00:44:56,980
When you're old enough,

581
00:44:57,320 --> 00:45:00,240
I'll make you a match with someone who's worthy of you,

582
00:45:00,600 --> 00:45:02,620
someone who's brave and gentle and strong...

583
00:45:02,620 --> 00:45:05,860
I don't want someone brave and gentle and strong. I want him!

584
00:45:05,860 --> 00:45:08,450
He'll be the greatest king that ever was, a golden lion,

585
00:45:08,450 --> 00:45:11,520
and I'll give him sons with beautiful blond hair.

586
00:45:11,910 --> 00:45:14,480
The lion's not a sigil, idiot.

587
00:45:14,480 --> 00:45:16,270
He's a stag, like his father.

588
00:45:16,270 --> 00:45:17,100
He is not.

589
00:45:17,100 --> 00:45:19,170
He's nothing like that old drunk king.

590
00:45:22,490 --> 00:45:24,840
Go on, girls. Get your septa and start packing your things.

591
00:45:24,840 --> 00:45:26,080
- Wait! - Come on.

592
00:45:26,080 --> 00:45:27,640
But it's not fair!

593
00:46:02,700 --> 00:46:05,590
"Lord Orys Baratheon, black of hair."

594
00:46:07,730 --> 00:46:10,220
"Axel Baratheon, black of hair."

595
00:46:11,150 --> 00:46:14,470
"Lyonel Baratheon, black of hair."

596
00:46:15,590 --> 00:46:18,500
"Steffon Baratheon, black of hair."

597
00:46:23,920 --> 00:46:26,730
"Robert Baratheon, black of hair."

598
00:46:28,920 --> 00:46:30,760
"Joffrey Baratheon...

599
00:46:31,780 --> 00:46:33,520
Golden-haired."

600
00:47:05,620 --> 00:47:06,930
Daenerys!

601
00:47:09,870 --> 00:47:11,220
Where's my sister?

602
00:47:11,370 --> 00:47:12,440
Stop him.

603
00:47:13,110 --> 00:47:14,280
Where is she?

604
00:47:19,220 --> 00:47:22,010
Where is she? I'm here for the feast.

605
00:47:22,600 --> 00:47:25,010
- The whore's feast? - Come.

606
00:47:25,010 --> 00:47:26,970
Get your hands off me!

607
00:47:26,970 --> 00:47:29,290
No one touches the dragon!

608
00:47:30,280 --> 00:47:32,800
Khal rhae mhar!

609
00:47:32,800 --> 00:47:34,570
Me ifa!

610
00:47:37,850 --> 00:47:39,440
Khal drogo!

611
00:47:40,310 --> 00:47:42,290
I'm here for the feast.

612
00:47:44,630 --> 00:47:46,940
Nevakhi vekha ha maan.

613
00:47:47,710 --> 00:47:50,390
Khal drogo says there is a place for you.

614
00:47:50,940 --> 00:47:52,350
Back there.

615
00:47:54,690 --> 00:47:56,770
That is no place for a king.

616
00:47:57,210 --> 00:47:59,880
You are no king.

617
00:48:01,880 --> 00:48:03,960
Keep away from me!

618
00:48:03,960 --> 00:48:06,130
Viserys, please.

619
00:48:08,650 --> 00:48:10,020
There she is.

620
00:48:14,450 --> 00:48:15,680
Put the sword down.

621
00:48:15,680 --> 00:48:17,320
They'll kill us all.

622
00:48:17,320 --> 00:48:19,120
They can't kill us.

623
00:48:20,650 --> 00:48:24,410
They can't shed blood in their sacred city.

624
00:48:31,050 --> 00:48:32,590
But I can.

625
00:48:42,160 --> 00:48:44,080
I want what I came for.

626
00:48:44,970 --> 00:48:47,270
I want the crown he promised me.

627
00:48:47,910 --> 00:48:49,430
He bought you.

628
00:48:49,590 --> 00:48:51,440
But he never paid for you.

629
00:48:57,380 --> 00:48:59,410
Tell him I want what was bargained for

630
00:48:59,410 --> 00:49:00,700
or I'm taking you back.

631
00:49:01,310 --> 00:49:03,090
He can keep the baby.

632
00:49:03,690 --> 00:49:05,970
I'll cut it out and leave it for him.

633
00:49:09,850 --> 00:49:12,700
Anha vazhak maan rek me zala.

634
00:49:14,120 --> 00:49:17,590
Anha vazhak maan firikhnharen hoshora

635
00:49:17,700 --> 00:49:21,270
Ma mahrazhi aqovi affin mori atihi mae!

636
00:49:21,270 --> 00:49:22,740
What's he saying?

637
00:49:24,030 --> 00:49:25,810
He says yes.

638
00:49:27,170 --> 00:49:30,860
You shall have a golden crown...

639
00:49:31,720 --> 00:49:34,860
that men shall tremble to behold.

640
00:49:45,670 --> 00:49:47,470
That was all I wanted.

641
00:49:49,990 --> 00:49:51,840
What-what was promised.

642
00:50:09,010 --> 00:50:10,300
Qora mae.

643
00:50:13,200 --> 00:50:14,160
No!

644
00:50:14,160 --> 00:50:16,810
No! You cannot touch me.

645
00:50:16,810 --> 00:50:19,280
I am the dragon. I am the dragon!

646
00:50:19,290 --> 00:50:21,850
I want my crown! Ahh!

647
00:50:23,450 --> 00:50:25,020
Aammeni haz jolin!

648
00:50:34,200 --> 00:50:36,300
- Look away, Khaleesi. - No.

649
00:50:43,740 --> 00:50:45,420
No, Dany.

650
00:50:45,820 --> 00:50:47,230
Dany, tell them.

651
00:50:47,970 --> 00:50:49,330
Make them!

652
00:50:50,140 --> 00:50:51,610
Dany, make them...

653
00:50:54,180 --> 00:50:55,580
No, you can't!

654
00:50:56,670 --> 00:50:59,050
Just...please!

655
00:50:59,850 --> 00:51:01,960
Dany, please!

656
00:51:04,160 --> 00:51:06,370
A crown for a king.

657
00:51:22,080 --> 00:51:23,580
Khaleesi?

658
00:51:24,310 --> 00:51:26,240
He was no dragon.

659
00:51:27,320 --> 00:51:30,030
Fire cannot kill a dragon.

